sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant API as FastAPI API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis / RQ

    Client->>API: POST /jobs (Payload & Idempotency Key)
    API->>DB: Check Idempotency & Insert Job (QUEUED)
    DB-->>API: Job Record Committed
    API->>Redis: Enqueue Task ID
    Redis-->>API: Enqueued Successfully
    API-->>Client: 201 Created (Job ID, Status: QUEUED)
